<p>Imbues your shields with arcane power, dealing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">23, 31, 37, 42, 46</acronym> arcane damage with each melee strike and <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">16, 21, 26, 29, 32</acronym> arcane damage when hit.</p><p>Your shields radiate with eldritch forces, imbuing you back with <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">5, 6, 7, 9, 10</acronym> spellpower and mindpower per tier of your shields (offhand counts for half). Current bonus is 0.</p><p>Allows counterstrikes after incomplete blocks and the cooldown of Block is reduced by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">0, 1, 2, 2, 2</acronym> turns.</p><p>The damage will increase with Spellpower.</p>